03yuhp5TPUxV2mK3JllKYihg3DuI8fJum_DCMmQWKZPg6Zn1ureTVM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS_sFJOu7zdXGERi717y2VNfOM0tOgAxXpV05NH48NSiw&oe=6AFC8D31"}, "display_name": "Karakuri Ninja VR", "keywords": ["Ninja", "Samurai", "Japan", "Sword", "Fighting"], "long_description": "Karakuri Ninja VR is a ninja action game in which players fight using weapons and ninjutsu in a virtual reality world.\n\nThe game immerses you in exciting battles against ninja robots and golems in stages inspired by Sengoku-era Japan.\n\n{855149423484564}\n\nEach stage features a variety of weapons such as Japanese swords, kunai, and shuriken, as well as items that enhance weapons to advance the battle situation.\n\n{1689142684961349}\n\nPlayers who are skilled ninja can use special ninjutsu such as energy balls and aura shields.\n\n{1285994962586025}\n\nHowever, enemies also attack with fire and lightning ninjutsu. In a ninja fight, one must carefully observe the enemy's actions and never miss the moment to strike.\n\n{1067989811457852}\n\nIn Karakuri Ninja VR, as you progress through the stages, more powerful enemies will appear. Hone your swordsmanship and ninjutsu skills and face them bravely.", "short_description": "Karakuri Ninja VR is a ninja action game in which players fight using weapons and ninjutsu in a virtual reality world."}]}, "developer_name": "Odd Team XR Studios", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://karakuri-kengeki.com/ninja-vr/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Odd Team XR Studios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://karakuri-kengeki.com/ninja-vr/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "2710427532541308"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection":